  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a particle of mass 1 gm and charge 1.0 Coulomb is at rest. Now the particle is subjected to an electric field $E(t)=E_0 \\sin \\omega t$ in the $x$-direction, where $E_0=2$ Newton/Coulomb and $\\omega=1000 \\mathrm{rad} / \\mathrm{sec}$. The maximum speed attained by the particle is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
