  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$V_{\\max }=\\frac{1}{m} \\int_0^{\\frac{T}{2}} F d t,=\\frac{1}{m} \\int_0^{\\frac{T}{2}} q E_0 \\sin (\\omega t) d t$\n$=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{qE}_0}{\\mathrm{~m} \\omega}=4 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
